+# Port of live hotfix v74h1 into v75 (for Codex)
+
+Branch: `claude/port-v74h1-to-v75` (based on `codex/saas-foundation` @ `6124066`). Not merged.
+
+## What is live on main since 2026-10-18 (`0bf3042`)
+1. Real USD/ILS by date — `fayna-fx.js` (ECB via Frankfurter, cached; monthly table only offline).
+2. Finance ledger no longer drops USD rows in the ILS view — `saas-finance-currency.js` (Codex's module, note text updated).
+3. The ₪ toggle actually converts home + journal, per trade at its own date's rate.
+4. Tradovate import: `$(12.50)` was read as +12.50 (all losses became gains); partial fills with identical time/price/qty were deduped away. `fayna-tradovate-repair.js` offers (with confirmation) to fix already-imported trades.
+5. In-app subscription notice — `fayna-announce.js` (no email, no writes).
+
+## How it is done in v75 (respects `scripts/validate-app.cjs`)
+- The live hotfix edited inline code; in v75 the same behaviour comes from **`fayna-currency-display.js`**, which wraps `histRate`, `toggleCurrency`, `_homeMoney` and `renderTJ` at runtime (same pattern as `saas-finance-currency.js`). Inline scripts are unchanged except `renderHome` (allowed by the guard).
+- `renderHome` passes `netOf` (= `_fxNet` when ₪ is on) to `_homeModel` and to `SaasDashboard.decorate`.
+- `saas-dashboard.js` formats with ILS when ₪ is on.
+- `fayna-import.js`, `fayna-fx.js`, `fayna-announce.js`, `fayna-tradovate-repair.js` identical to main.
+- `sw.js` VERSION → `fayna-v75-ui5-fx1`.
+
+## Checks run
+`validate-app` ✓ · saas-dashboard, import-atas, chart-symbol, delete-trades, data-export, trade-markers, default-theme, finance-currency, finance-summary ✓ · new: `tests/import-tradovate.cjs`, `tests/fx.cjs` ✓.
+Browser (Chromium, real v75 HTML, Firebase stubbed, synthetic trades): ₪ toggle home/journal/rows equal live numbers; finance ILS keeps USD rows; announce → repair order; no page errors.
+Not run here: `tests/saas-browser.cjs` (needs Edge) and the emulator suite — please run them in CI.
+
+## Note for Codex
+- When v75 replaces v74 on main, keep these five modules and `fayna-currency-display.js`; do not reintroduce a fixed 3.65/3.5 rate.
+- Main's `index.html` (v74h1) had one CRLF style line normalised to LF by the hotfix tooling — whitespace only.
